{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22178","headline":"冬夜 · 白居易","name":"冬夜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家贫亲爱散，身病交游罢。\n眼前无一人，独掩村斋卧。\n冷落灯火闇，离披帘幕破。\n策策窗户前，又闻新雪下。\n长年渐省睡，夜半起端坐。\n不学坐忘心，寂莫安可过。\n兀然身寄世，浩然心委化。\n如此来四年，一千三百夜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22178.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22178","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}